[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `girara`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked at a later
version, with `aws-sdk-cpp-qapps`. The later `girara` no longer needs
`gtk+3.0`, which needs `gobject-introspection` and
`gtk-update-icon-cache`, in that order, by their names; the installed
database lists them in that order too. apk removes `gtk+3.0`, then
`gtk-update-icon-cache`, then `gobject-introspection`: `gtk+3.0` was
needed through a name it provides at a version, so they are among the
removals left for last, and the packages a removal there frees go the one
the database lists last first
(`installed/the-last-removals-a-removal-frees-go-the-one-given-last-first`).

[repository]
P:girara
V:2026.02.04-r0

[installed]
P:gobject-introspection
V:1.86.0-r0

P:gtk-update-icon-cache
V:3.24.51-r0

P:gtk+3.0
V:3.24.51-r0
D:gobject-introspection gtk-update-icon-cache
p:so:libgdk-3.so.0=0.2419.32

P:girara
V:0.4.5-r4
D:so:libgdk-3.so.0

[request]
girara>0.4.5-r4

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade girara 0.4.5-r4 2026.02.04-r0
remove gtk+3.0 3.24.51-r0
remove gtk-update-icon-cache 3.24.51-r0
remove gobject-introspection 1.86.0-r0
